\ Protocol-bounded call site in AOT runtime-image mode. The call site
\ emits the satisfies-and-dispatch helper-call, verifying the helper
\ emission path compiles and links.
\
\ User-defined protocols are parse-time: the descriptor is created at
\ build time and does not survive into the runtime context. The slot is
\ null when the helper is first called, so the call fails and the binary
\ exits with an error. Descriptor reconstruction from image data is
\ deferred to a later milestone.

addable: protocol{ bump-it: } ;
bump-it: generic ( x: addable -- n ) [ drop 0 ] ;

\ Protocol-bounded call site: compiled output emits aotSatisfiesAndDispatch.
bounded-caller: ( x: addable -- n ) [ bump-it ] ;

1 bounded-caller .
